    "note": "Reported by the Senate Government Oversight and Reform Committee (03_RS), Sub. H.B. 425, 133rd GA; the bill's passage vote(s) and any later amendments are not in the text read. The old penalty paragraph for violating (B)(1) (first-degree misdemeanor, or minor misdemeanor if the officer knew of the license) is struck, so no stated penalty remains for (B)(1). R.C. 2923.126, 2923.128 and 2923.16 get matching timing/wording changes (not quoted)."
